{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach, take and move to processing area. If property, do task A or B otherwise default.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToProcessingArea    /> <Action ID = DoTaskA    /> <Action ID = DoTaskB    /> <Action ID = DefaultTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = HasProperty1    /> <Condition ID = HasProperty2    />",
